            </div>

            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-review" role="tabpanel">
              <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-7">
                  <h3 class="head">23 Reviews</h3>
                  <% [{name: "Jacob Webb", image: "person_1.jpg"}, {name: "Jacob Webb", image: "person_2.jpg"}, {name: "Jacob Webb", image: "person_3.jpg"}].each do |review| %>
                    <div class="review d-flex">
                      <div class="user-img" style="background-image: url('/uptown/images/<%= review[:image] %>')"></div>
                      <div class="desc">
                        <h4>
                          <span class="text-left"><%= review[:name] %></span>
                          <span class="text-right">14 March 2018</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p class="star">
                          <span><i class="ion-ios-star"></i><i class="ion-ios-star"></i><i class="ion-ios-star"></i><i class="ion-ios-star"></i><i class="ion-ios-star"></i></span>
                          <span class="text-right"><a href="#" class="reply"><i class="icon-reply"></i></a></span>
                        </p>
                        <p>When she reached the first hills of the Italic Mountains, she had a last view back on the skyline of her hometown Bookmarksgrov</p>
